{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2021-08-26 09:05:00', 'title': 'SYNOPSYS INITIATES $175 MILLION ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE AGREEMENT', 'text': 'MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF., AUG. 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SYNOPSYS, INC. (NASDAQ: SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE AGREEMENT (ASR) WITH HSBC BANK USA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION TO REPURCHASE AN AGGREGATE OF $175 MILLION OF SYNOPSYS STOCK.'}